      "sourceExcerpt": "Power off. Disconnect leads. Measure across solenoid terminals \u2014 216 \u03a9 \u00b110%.",
      "measurementKnowledgeId": "whirlpoolFreestandingRangeDsiValveOhms",
      "testPoint": {
